<http://data.silknow.org/object/6e450f86-108f-3eb5-b2d4-4c1208ceda2c/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress fabric of woven silk and metal thread.\n\nWarp: pink silk,\nWeft: white, dark green, grey and pink silk.\nMetal thread: silver strip open S-wound on yellow silk.\nPieced in one corner. metal thread ground with a small pattern of a leafy ogival flattened lattice in white with a simple 4-petalled rosette in white with a pink centre, all edged in grey. Each compartment contains a 6-petalled flower head in grey, a pink bud and green leaves all edged in white."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/6e450f86-108f-3eb5-b2d4-4c1208ceda2c> .

